content-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819239_1610696490094841_410451601663953355_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AcTDSdYYUcEQ7kNvwHcBanj&_nc_oc=AdobMV8C5YMvXNlLVUGHYe3YQR9XTbd5sPBsVYdunaLfbGYZc-voLZr8PPT-Qmo1puQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8NJ-sfJaTBmZpCkMA0Viefz1gRY5rJcFmxdmgbgDwibA&oe=6A3BE692"}, "display_name": "DamnedSchool", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**Magic. Puzzles. Action. Together in VR.**\nDive into a physics-based fantasy action shooter that pulls you straight into the adventure.\n\n- Face monstrous enemies up close with realistic physics\n- Unleash powerful spells\n- Explore mysterious places and solve ancient puzzles\n- Experience thrilling action solo or in co-op multiplayer with friends\n- Enjoy full immersion in a vibrant, interactive fantasy world\n\nFeel the power of magic, overcome the darkness \u2013 and embark on adventures only possible in VR.", "short_description": "Experience a physics-based VR fantasy shooter filled with magic, puzzles, and epic battles. Fight solo or in co-op, cast spells with your hands, and face monstrous enemies in a living fantasy world."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "titel_2560_1440logo.png", "id": "25353286670939764", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818874_25353286684273096_5729733783226815280_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pCzt0Ix3OvQQ7kNvwH6JPl1&_nc_oc=Adr7T25RxRA4LderN5j9DZEQG6ne5MDhBgb6XOiZlT-lu9TDSXzwuyWAsXKaLHCTqVI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_hbZ3seg7j1T1cqEXbFY-_EM-VaOg5U4NKlAw9Vmp_RA&oe=6A3BD808"}, {"file_name": "symbolSolid512.png", "id": "2214463079017250", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819336_2214463082350583_1145808276885830663_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Yc-ANwe9tJUQ7kNvwHJTh3D&_nc_oc=AdopNkDYKJ-jdhFEcynkS5DfrUqY